{"name":"Foundation","hex":"#f8e8c5","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"foundation","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of founding, fixing, establishing, or beginning to erect.","That upon which anything is founded; that on which anything stands, and by which it is supported; the lowest and supporting layer of a superstructure; underbuilding."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/foundation"}],"entries":[{"title":"Foundation (cosmetics)","blocks":[{"text":"Foundation is a liquid, cream, or powder cosmetic applied to the face and neck to create an even, uniform color to the complexion, typically to cover flaws and change the natural skin tone. Foundation applied to the body is referred to as \"body painting\" or \"body makeup\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Foundation_%28cosmetics%29.jpg/330px-Foundation_%28cosmetics%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_(cosmetics)"},{"title":"Foundation (engineering)","blocks":[{"text":"In engineering, a foundation is the element of a structure that connects it to the ground, or more rarely water, transferring loads from the structure to the ground. Foundations are generally considered either shallow or deep. Foundation engineering is the application of soil mechanics and rock mechanics in the design of foundation elements of structures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Mock_foundations_for_House_and_Apartment.png/330px-Mock_foundations_for_House_and_Apartment.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_(engineering)"},{"title":"Foundation (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Foundation is an American science fiction television series created by David S. Goyer and Josh Friedman for Apple TV+, based on the Foundation series of stories by Isaac Asimov. It features an ensemble cast led by Jared Harris, Lee Pace, Lou Llobell, Leah Harvey, and Laura Birn. The series premiered on September 24, 2021. The second and third seasons were released in July 2023 and July 2025, respectively. In September 2025, the series was renewed for a fourth season."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foundation_(TV_series)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Foundation_2.jpg/500px-Foundation_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Foundation_2.jpg/1280px-Foundation_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Foundation_2.jpg/500px-Foundation_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A foundation with pipe fixtures coming through the sleeves","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFoundation_2.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg/500px-Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg/1280px-Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg/500px-Lincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_%2853566542487%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pouring a concrete foundation","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALincoln_Park_Affordable_Housing_Phase_2_(53566542487).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.w